OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear periods. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will remain dry
OL,8,Fbut some high cloud spreading from the
OL,9,Fwest. Chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FMainly dry with some bright
OL,12,For sunny spells. A few light showers
OL,13,Facross western Tayside.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,16,FShowers in the west on Wednesday
OL,17,Fmorning will spread across the east in
OL,18,Fthe afternoon. Dry and bright on
OL,19,FThursday, rain by evening. Early rain
OL,20,Fon Friday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
